6s0dn4 x1coeszu x1n2onr6 x1vjfegm\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-tippy-trigger-hover=\"\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1coeszu x1n2onr6 x1vjfegm x1jnr06f\" data-tippy-delegate-id=\"_r_u7v_\" data-tippy-trigger-hover=\"\" style=\"color: var(--x1ymkdt3);\"><img class=\"x19kjcj4 xw4jnvo x1qx5ct2 xhdc4oz\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.mobalytics.gg/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,width=96/assets/poe-2/images/game/Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/RangerDeadeyeMirageSkill.webp\"><span class=\"xirccme xggjnk3\">Mirage Deadeye</span></span></span></span></span><br></p><p class=\"x1f3rem xirccme xw7yly9\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"x117nqv4\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Weapon Set:</strong><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Follow the Weapon set I have above. Essentially you want all of your DPS skills on weapon set 1 and </span><span class=\"x1rg5ohu xxymvpz xirccme xo5v014\" id=\"node-portal-7401\" data-lexical-decorator=\"true\" contenteditable=\"false\"><span class=\"x1lliihq\" data-test-display=\"inline\" data-testid=\"static-data-widget\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1coeszu x1n2onr6 x1vjfegm\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-tippy-trigger-hover=\"\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x6s0dn4 x1coeszu x1n2onr6 x1vjfegm x1jnr06f\" data-tippy-delegate-id=\"_r_u81_\" data-tippy-trigger-hover=\"\" style=\"color: var(--x1ymkdt3);\"><img class=\"x19kjcj4 xw4jnvo x1qx5ct2 xhdc4oz\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.mobalytics.gg/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,width=96/assets/poe-2/images/game/Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/FreezingMarkSkill.webp\"><span class=\"xirccme xggjnk3\">Freezing Mark</span></span></span></span></span><span data-lexical-text=\"true\"> on weapon set 2.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
  "selected_tab": "Uber Endgame",
  "text": "Passive Tree\nEarly\nnon-crit Midgame\nnon-crit Hybrid swap\nCrit Hybrid\nUber Endgame\nLive Gear\nMain:\n-20\n123\nSet 1:\n0\n24\nSet 2:\n0\n24\nNotable Priority\nTrack Build\n+23\nShow All\n\nTake whatever attribute you need at the time, you'll default to dex if you don't need anything, after 161 dex you should default to strength for more HP.\n\nOnce you have \nRakiata's Flow\n you can takeout \nSnowpiercer\n and instead take \nBeastial Skin\n for more defense.\n\nThis is a level 96 tree. Takeout some Evasion/energy shield hybrid nodes if you're lower lvl.\n\nIf you have projectile speed on your quiver, you should also take \nFeathered Fletching\n\n\n\nBeastial Skin\n is a very solid evasion node if you want higher evasion (can also anoint this).\n\nAscendancy order:\n\nProjectile Proximity Specialisation\n(point blank) -> \nEndless Munitions\n -> \nGathering Winds\n -> \nMirage Deadeye\n\n\n\nWeapon Set:\nFollow the Weapon set I have above. Essentially you want all of your DPS skills on weapon set 1 and \nFreezing Mark\n on weapon set 2."
}